OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FShowers and brighter spells.
OL,6,FShowers focused in the west,
OL,7,Foccasionally turning heavy during the
OL,8,Fmorning and early afternoon, bringing
OL,9,Fa risk of thunderstorms. Showers
OL,10,Feasing from the southeast for the late
OL,11,Fafternoon. Brisk winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers dying away from the
OL,14,Feast during the evening to leave a
OL,15,Flargely dry night with clear spells
OL,16,Fappearing most readily in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
