OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FWindy. Most staying dry
OL,6,Fthrough to mid-afternoon with some
OL,7,Flimited early brightness. Patchy rain
OL,8,Ffeeding from the west late afternoon
OL,9,Fto early evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FEarly
OL,12,Frain Thursday across the east,
OL,13,Fclearing erratically as brighter
OL,14,Fspells and showers feed from west.
OL,15,FScattered showers for Friday, focused
OL,16,Fin west. Saturday mainly dry,
OL,17,Foccasionally bright.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
